<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Dec 20, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Dec 20   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,542   1,823   2,560</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     103	 4     938</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 1,666   1,848   3,532</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,601   2,648   6,663</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     476     433   3,283</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     30	30     995</p>
<p>Total					 2,107   3,111  10,941</p>
<p>Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing. (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
